Code dependencies

- symphonia (audio decoding for MP3, AAC, ALAC, FLAC, Vorbis, WAV, AIFF, CAF) is used unmodified
  under the Mozilla Public License 2.0; its source is available at
  https://github.com/pdeljanov/Symphonia.
- The H.264, HEVC, VP9, AV1, Opus, MP4, Matroska and Ogg crates under crates/ are ported from
  FilmCraft (same owner, MIT OR Apache-2.0).
- The shared Craft interface crates craft-ui and craft-cloud (the share dialog, the account
  badge, the presence row and the cloud Open and Save pages) are built from source, pinned by git
  revision, from https://github.com/wdunn001/craft-libs under MIT OR Apache-2.0.
- The CollabCraft client crates craft-cloud-client and collabcraft-share (how the desktop app
  reaches the cloud service) are built from source, pinned by git revision, from
  https://github.com/wdunn001/collabcraft. That repository ships LICENSE-MIT and LICENSE-APACHE
  while its Cargo metadata declares AGPL-3.0-or-later. The contradiction is upstream's to
  settle.
